The release binaries live here: `save.bat build` copies them out of
target\release\.

    TelegramExporter.exe    the exporter's window
    TelegramAnalyser.exe    the analyser: a window, or a command with arguments

Until the two become one TelegramTools.exe (TELEGRAMTOOLS.md, phase 2), both
come out of one `cargo build --release`, so a dist\ can never hold one of them
from Tuesday and the other from Friday.

They sit in the repo rather than in target\ because target\ is a build
directory -- `cargo clean` empties it -- and because the exporter keeps its
state beside its executable. Running dist\TelegramExporter.exe therefore puts
dist\TelegramExporterData\ and dist\Exports\ next to it, which is what makes
the folder portable: copy dist\ anywhere and it works, credentials and all.

Everything in here except this file is gitignored, for that last reason.
